## Re-running bootstrap

Safe: `bootstrap.py` skips files that already exist unless `--force` is
passed, and `--force` backs each overwritten file up to
`<filename>.pre-bootstrap.bak` first. Re-run it after pulling a newer project-bootstrap to add any *new*
template files; then reconcile differences by hand and update the date in
the table above for anything actually re-installed.
